{
  "bookId": "hero-212014",
  "id": "bond-29329",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29329001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "主人，今天也坚持下来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是啊，运动后的心情真是畅快。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这段时间每天都在陪真乃晨跑，渐渐地也形成了习惯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "话说……后宅这怎么多了一栋大房子？出发的时候好像还没看到……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是只属于你的新家哦，进去看看吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊啊啊，这是真的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "装修得好漂亮，还有宽敞的露天阳台……就像是能看到海景的别墅一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜……我要感动得哭出来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "别哭啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "（抽泣声）我都还没做什么，就收到了这么贵重的礼物……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你已经足够努力了，最近后宅也是你在主动打扫吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "（抽泣声）对不起……我只是太开心了。好了……眼泪就此打住。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……我马上就去帮主人烧洗澡水！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "等下，我自己会去……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "运动后的泡澡，还有缓解疲劳的按摩！这些都包在真乃身上吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女的眼中有着熊熊燃烧的，不容拒绝的热情。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……好，有劳了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "从今天起，主人的生活就都由我来照顾！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29329019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "停！你冷静一下……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
